WEBVTT

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.700
It's hot.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.320
It's so hot.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.290
Why is it so hot?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.830
'Cause it's summer.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.970
What's wrong?

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:05.100
Well, there's a silver-haired heroic beauty at that window.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.890
What? A silver-haired heroic beauty?

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.400
Hold on.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.860
There's no such girl in my checklist.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.860
Ah, delicious.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.490
This is what you should do during the summer.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.870
Haruko-senpai, thank you for the treat.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:28.410
I used to eat these in the park with Take-chan all the time.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:32.380
But is it fine for us to be doing this?

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.630
Well, we need to relax once in a while.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:41.890
Trouble has increased ever since the school became co-ed, and we've been stressed out.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.010
That's right.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.890
Our president's afternoons have been getting longer as well.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:49.930
Especially when Akaya-sensei is away.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.190
That's true.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:57.400
Geez. We've said too many awkward things.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.740
What's "true", Haruko-san?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.740
President.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.330
Resting is fine,

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:11.040
but don't forget about your role as the student council vice-president.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.000
Yes, I'll be careful, President.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.170
Also,

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.170
another member of the Venus team has arrived at Tenbi.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.430
I'd like you to look after that person.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.930
Look after another member?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.020
I'm fine on my own.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.600
I'm here.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.610
Wh-when did she get there?

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.280
You're the new member from Venus?

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.950
That's correct.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.570
Nice to meet you, everyone of the Maken-Ki.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.700
Ah, that's dangerous.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.340
Cool, like a ninja.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.510
Could you be a ninja from overseas?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:01.920
Eh?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.590
Your eyes...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.180
Ah, no.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:12.310
It's not like I can't see, but I'm closing my eyes because of various reasons.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.440
Thanks to this,

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.560
my hearing has become better.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.440
What's this?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.320
What happened?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.070
A beige full back and white ones.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.320
Oh, that's a pretty cute image.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:30.160
That's Mr. Frog.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.080
Is this your power?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:38.330
Excuse me. I wanted to know what was fashionable among Japanese high school girls.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.800
I love girls like you.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.220
Where is she?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.770
Where's the silver-haired heroic beauty?

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.270
I don't know.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:00.940
Damn. How come you were the only one who saw her?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.190
God, why are you always bullying me?

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:06.320
What are you saying?

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.030
God?

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:11.330
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.910
I'm talking to the one who's looking at me with the savage eyes of a lowlife, of course.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.580
You, who disgusts me.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:24.300
Who'd look at a primary school girl like you?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:30.220
You're being too self-aware, Idiot.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.360
What?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:50.620
If you fall on your knees and beg right now, I might forgive you.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:55.620
Very well. How about you lick my shoes

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.000
Hey, Witness. This is a battle.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.870
Hurry it up.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.580
Are you gonna let them?

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.090
Ah, I have to, don't I?

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.840
Just to be safe, go contact the Kenkeibu.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.130
Understood. Don't get involved again.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.260
Now, let's start the battle.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.270
The path of the sun

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.520
shall be imprinted in the sky.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:22.860
Maken Engage: Kaesto.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.650
Make Pride.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:37.450
My Kaesto's ability pulls the opponent to an area where our fists can reach each other.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:41.080
If you apologize now, I'll let you go after you lick my shoes ten times.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.670
You stink.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.420
This smelly scum is making me wanna puke.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.720
Don't joke around.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:56.850
Maken Zone: Grooming Garden.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.890
You're a real idiot.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:07.900
Even though you were trying to put yourself in a favorable situation, in the end, you walked into my territory.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.570
What's going on?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.780
The two of them haven't been moving since a while ago.

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.580
The battle has been decided.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:17.910
Eh?

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.420
My little sister can create her own special space.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:29.380
Someone entering that Maken, Doll House's territory, will become controlled by my little sister.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:34.430
Now, where should I start playing?

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.600
His arm.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:43.060
My little sister's Maken can make a doll linked to her opponent.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:47.980
Damage induced to the doll will be transfered to the opponent a hundredfold.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.570
Stop it.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.070
Since you've already won, you should stop.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.110
What?

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.320
Do you intend to get in my way?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.120
Let me make you a doll as well.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.460
Fall on your knees before me.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.590
This is where the fun starts.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.840
It's not because the opponent is a girl.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:21.180
I just can't forgive the fact that the weak are beaten up one-sidedly.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.520
What?

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.270
Impossible.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.360
The doll's beyond control.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.900
Stop your Maken immediately.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.240
This guy dares to resist me.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.410
I'll kill you.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.710
That girl...

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.590
Where did you come from?

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.220
From here on,

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.470
you better stop.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.770
W-What do you mean?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.230
Are you ordering me?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.810
No matter how highly Grandpa thinks of you...

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.980
You've overdone it a little.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:17.240
If anything had happened, what would you have intended to do?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.490
I-I was just playing a small prank.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.750
Instead of me, you should take care of the job you received.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:32.630
Slack off, and I'll tell my grandpa, Kamigari's Chief.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.130
Are you all right?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.390
Yeah.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.520
Um, you stopped this battle.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.900
I've taken emergency measures,

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.770
but he's still hurt.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.070
He needs treatment at once.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.230
Yes.

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:58.150
Takeru, are you all right?

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.700
Takeru-sama.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.910
I'm Minerva Martha of Venus.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:07.330
From today on, I'll be attending Tenbi Academy.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.670
It may be for just a short period, but let's get along.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.540
Ooyama-san, actually,

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:16.880
the countermeasure you took during yesterday's commotion around that battle

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.300
has caused difficulties within the school.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.430
I understand.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:26.430
Additionally, you haven't passed your Element exam, either.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.060
Eh? How do you know that?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.940
We've received a report from the principal.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:38.190
Controlling Elements is fundamental when using Maken.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:43.280
A Maken-Ki member has never failed the test before.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:43.950
Thus...

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.620
You're fired?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.660
Maken-Ki.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.630
Maken-Ki.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:01.380
Only if I fail the upcoming makeup examinations, though.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.510
Well, don't be so depressed.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.810
The Maken-Ki doesn't mean life for you.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:11.390
I want to be together with Takeru-sama at all times.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.400
Or else my position as fiancée...

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.110
That's right.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:20.950
If you take your eyes off of Take-chan for a bit, he'll turn to another girl at once.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.410
What a bad excuse.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:26.280
It has nothing to do with me.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.790
What happened?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.910
Is anything troubling you?

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:36.420
Ah, you're the silver-haired heroic beauty.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.510
As I thought. She's not in here. She's not on my list.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:42.430
She's Minerva-san, who was admitted here yesterday.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:47.930
Why are you the only one who knows again? You bastard!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.930
Calm down.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.680
I see.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:54.150
The makeup exam is tomorrow after school.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.150
Provided he gets the knack, learning everything in one day is possible.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:04.820
In that case, why don't we ask everyone to help?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.120
Which means...

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.330
Something like a training camp.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.210
A training camp?

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:19.710
What's the meaning of this, Takeru-kun?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.800
This is the situation I wanted to see.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.390
You seem to be misunderstanding something.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.720
It's not like that.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:28.430
Eh?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.850
Multiple women competing for a guy they're around is just like a harem story.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.020
Isn't it a standard in this country?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.480
Which country are you talking about?

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:43.070
Anyway, we should prepare dinner.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.070
What's your name?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.990
I gave him the name "Monji."

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.700
Take-chan, do your best practicing.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.370
Eh? Just me?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:52.500
Trying hard on your own first is the proper way, isn't it?

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.460
I'll check on you later.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.960
Understood. Leave it to me.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.750
Hey, come on. You dropout.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.050
Hey, Usui...

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:06.760
Although they're idiots, at least their friendship is beautiful.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.390
Are you always here in a group of four?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.020
Yes, every day is fun.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.810
Well, it won't get boring.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.560
We just happened to live together because of the housing allocation.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.230
Oh? We just "happened" to be?

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.780
Himegami-san, this again?

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:28.530
Okay. I have a question for you three.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.820
What is it?

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:31.280
Is it something regarding the Maken-Ki?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.080
Do you have anyone you love?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:35.790
Eh?

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.160
What?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.540
Talking about love is a part of training camps.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.960
First off, Himegami-san. Please go ahead.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.590
Why are we starting with me?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.090
There's not much to talk about...

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.550
I understand. I'll talk.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.600
Well, whatever.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.520
The last time I had someone I loved was a long time ago.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.810
Even if we could meet again,

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.570
we can't be together.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:09.530
How should I say it? He was always so close yet so far away from me.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:17.960
More importantly, you two should have much more interesting things to talk about.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.960
About that... Of course I know it's him, but...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.960
I-It's not really Take-chan.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.210
We only said "him."

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.970
So it's true.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.890
How about you, Inaho-san?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:38.560
Yeah, I love Takeru-sama.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.820
This isn't working at all.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:56.910
At this rate, you won't be able to hit the can that's five meters away on tomorrow's exam.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:02.210
Are you bothered by the fact that you couldn't stop a battle again?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.250
Shut up...

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:11.720
I don't know why you get tangled in those things, and I don't want to know, either.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:18.140
But if you believe that you're right, just go through with it.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.730
Usui, you...

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.230
I only do what I want to do as well.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:28.230
That's why I can enjoy this paradise.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:33.240
In my future, I want to live in a big white house with Takeru-sama, raise a big dog...

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.240
Ah, and of course, be together with Monji.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:40.870
I also want to have three sons and two daughters.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.210
Hm... More would be fine, too.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:47.130
You have such a detailed plan for your future already?

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.250
Now then...

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.260
Oh, what's wrong?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.680
I guess it's time to check up on how he's doing with his training.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.850
I'll come as well.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.010
Well, be at ease.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:03.100
You can just cook a tasty meal for him.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.020
I'll help right away.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.400
That's right.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:13.530
Haruko, just do what you can do.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.530
That's more like you.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.830
Inaho-chan, we're gonna make a lot, so get fired up.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.300
Yes. By the way, what are we cooking?

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.300
Anyway, we'll just cook a lot.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:54.240
If I can control my breath with an Element,

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:01.240
I can make miracles happen.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.080
Did he do it?

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.590
Inconceivable.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:18.800
I can feel the amount of Elements suddenly increasing.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.600
Remarkable! You finally hit it, Takeru.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.980
Moreover, is that your doing as well?

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.770
I-I don't know.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.450
Ojou, someone's here.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.660
I know.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.280
It looks like it's not Takeru and that other guy.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.620
How about we stop this game of hide and seek?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.700
Minerva.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.500
So you noticed me.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:56.840
You were following, or rather, observing me, right?

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:00.340
Yes, you have some cute Shikigami there.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.260
What?

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.770
Perhaps, Himegami-san, too.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.890
You can see the Element itself?

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:12.900
Then how do I look in your eyes?

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:17.070
Why did you allow Minerva-san to go alone?

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:24.410
Himegami Kodama holds a clue to what Kamigari, Yamato Ouken, wants.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.910
First of all, I'd like Minerva

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:33.670
to continue carrying out our mission after, so we won't be too late.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.420
Captain Akaya, I'd like to ask one question.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:45.430
Why did you order us to live as normal students in Tenbi Academy?

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.600
Let's see.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.270
Good timing.

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:51.100
I'd like to ask you something, too.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.860
Do you like this school?

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.240
Yes, I like Takeru-kun and his friends.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.120
Although most of them are idiots, in general, they're not bad.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.080
I like this school.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.120
The students as well.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:11.830
What about Demitra?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.460
I don't know,

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:20.420
but compared to the discrimination and persecution of ability users in the outside world,

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.890
this place is too warm.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.930
After so many problems, you can still call this place warm?

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.180
Vice-Captain, your words are unusual.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:37.360
Right now, your answer is reassuring to me.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:43.570
You have seen my real body, haven't you?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:52.290
Himegami-san, before your existence breaks the seal of Amanohara,

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.540
we of Venus have received orders to bring you to Kamigari.

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.050
What did you say?

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:02.090
